  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, doctor, the cough since we painted the house. We did the whole house, you know. Every room. My son-in-law said, Appa, hire a painter, but I said, why pay?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:10",
      "end_timestamp": "00:27",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I see. And the cough began when?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:29",
      "end_timestamp": "00:33",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "About three weeks back. Starting the second day of painting, it began. And it will not leave me.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:35",
      "end_timestamp": "00:45",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Worse near the paint fumes, even now. Yesterday I went to the garage, where the old tins are, and I coughed for ten minutes.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:54",
      "end_timestamp": "01:08",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Anything else started along with it?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:27",
      "end_timestamp": "01:31",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Sneezing, in the first week. A lot. But that has gone now, the sneezing is gone after we opened all the windows.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:32",
      "end_timestamp": "01:43",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, asthma since childhood. Also sinus problem, from my thirties. Both, I am carrying for years.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:55",
      "end_timestamp": "02:04",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And your inhaler, which one are you using?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:05",
      "end_timestamp": "02:10",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Budesonide, the brown one. The dose, I think 200 micrograms, maybe? Twice a day. The pharmacist knows better than me.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:11",
      "end_timestamp": "02:22",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "We'll confirm with the pharmacy. Any asthma in the family?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:25",
      "end_timestamp": "02:30",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "My mother had it badly. In her last years, she was always using the pump.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:32",
      "end_timestamp": "02:41",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you. And you worked in what field, before retirement?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:44",
      "end_timestamp": "02:49",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Bank manager, thirty-two years. Retired now. My granddaughter says I only watch cricket.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:51",
      "end_timestamp": "02:58",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Blood pressure 130 over 84. Pulse 82. Temperature 36.8. Oxygen 96 percent. Breathing rate 18.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:26",
      "end_timestamp": "03:34",
      "supports": [
        "vital_signs[0]",
        "vital_signs[1]",
        "vital_signs[2]",
        "vital_signs[3]",
        "vital_signs[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "There is a slight wheeze when you breathe out, mainly at the bases.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:15",
      "end_timestamp": "04:21",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "My impression is that the paint fumes irritated your lungs, so this is most likely an asthma flare.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:31",
      "end_timestamp": "04:40",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Likely, yes. I would like to order a lung function test, so we can see how your airways are working now.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:48",
      "end_timestamp": "04:59",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. Now, your options for the cough itself. One, keep the windows open and stay away from the garage and the old tins.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:22",
      "end_timestamp": "05:35",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Two, use your budesonide regularly, morning and evening, even when you feel fine.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:45",
      "end_timestamp": "05:51",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Three, let the house air out for another week or two before spending long hours in the freshly painted rooms.",
      "start_timestamp": "06:01",
      "end_timestamp": "06:10",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    }
